abstract: "Aegis Forge is an evidence-gated, crash-resilient autonomous software-repair control plane built for GitHub CI/CD workflows. It guarantees that no candidate patch is ever published until an independent verifier reproduces the failure, proves a regression test red on unmodified code, proves the test green in a clean sandbox, and cryptographically signs an in-toto v1 Statement encapsulated in an Ed25519 DSSE envelope."
